- Right.

181
00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:32.466
Frogadier, throw us another board.

182
00:09:32.533 --> 00:09:34.300
- Froga.
- Ha.

183
00:09:34.366 --> 00:09:37.400
That's perfect. We're getting close.

184
00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:45.966
- ♪ Che-e, a-pin, Che-e-e-e-e-espin ♪
- Aw. Isn't that sweet?

185
00:09:46.033 --> 00:09:48.566
Out on a mission for the twerps, which means...

186
00:09:48.633 --> 00:09:50.133
Catch as catch can.

187
00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:54.433
And after we catch 'em, we'll use 'em to reel in Pikachu.

188
00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:57.800
Now, that's a catchy plan. Shall we go, then?

189
00:09:57.866 --> 00:09:59.100
Tally-ho.

190
00:09:59.166 --> 00:10:01.066
Wobbuffet.

191
00:10:01.133 --> 00:10:03.466
Who's that Pokémon?

192
00:10:08.766 --> 00:10:11.166
It's Jigglypuff!

193
00:10:12.033 --> 00:10:13.333
Jigglypuff!

194
00:10:15.633 --> 00:10:17.433
Che!

195
00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:21.833
- Che! Pin.
- Bunnel.

196
00:10:24.766 --> 00:10:27.766
- Chespin.
- Bunnelby.

197
00:10:27.833 --> 00:10:29.500
Che. Chespin!

198
00:10:29.566 --> 00:10:31.933
By.

199
00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:34.066
Che! Pin?

200
00:10:34.133 --> 00:10:37.666
- Che...
- Bunn. By.

201
00:10:37.733 --> 00:10:38.966
Pin!

202
00:10:39.033 --> 00:10:42.366
Chespin, Chespin, Chespin, Chespin, pin, pin.

203
00:10:42.433 --> 00:10:45.433
- Che.
- Bunn, bunn, bunn. By!

204
00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:47.166
Che! Che!

205
00:10:48.466 --> 00:10:50.833
Chespin, Chespin, che.

206
00:10:51.066 --> 00:10:52.600
By?

207
00:10:52.666 --> 00:10:55.333
- Che!
- Bunnel. Bunnelby.

208
00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:57.766
Che!

209
00:10:57.833 --> 00:11:01.566
- Bunnel.
- Chespin, Chespin!

210
00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:06.066
Che!

211
00:11:07.366 --> 00:11:08.766
- Bunn?
- Chespin.

212
00:11:08.833 --> 00:11:09.933
- By!
- Che!

213
00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:11.766
- Fearow!
- Bunnelby!

214
00:11:11.833 --> 00:11:14.766
Fearow! Fearow!

215
00:11:14.833 --> 00:11:16.033
Che, che!

216
00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:19.533
- Che!
- Bunnelby. Bunnelby!

217
00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:20.966
Che, Chespin!

218
00:11:21.033 --> 00:11:24.666
Great. Now there won't be a problem, no matter how much it rains.

219
00:11:24.733 --> 00:11:26.400
- Cha.
- Frog.

220
00:11:26.466 --> 00:11:29.300
Huh? Why are you two dressed like that?

221
00:11:29.366 --> 00:11:30.766
Oh! Hi, Ash.

222
00:11:30.833 --> 00:11:34.666
