- Bunn, bunn, bunn!
- Che, che, che!

238
00:12:10.066 --> 00:12:11.500
- Fear!
- Che!

239
00:12:11.566 --> 00:12:14.133
- Chespin, pin!
- Bunn.

240
00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:15.733
- Che.
- By?

241
00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:19.133
- Chespin!
- Bunn!

242
00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:22.933
Un! By! Bunnelby!

243
00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:24.800
