- Fearow!

246
00:12:30.766 --> 00:12:33.233
- Che, che!
- Bunnelby!

247
00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:35.766
- Chespin!
- Bunnelby!

248
00:12:36.666 --> 00:12:38.933
Fearow!

249
00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:43.266
-Fearow!

250
00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:46.700
- Bunn, bunn, bunn.
- Che, che, che.

251
00:12:46.766 --> 00:12:48.000
Bunnelby! By!

